            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Screen Setter 2.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Settings are reorganized. The sidebar lists your display sets under <b>Layouts</b>, then <b>General</b>, <b>Shortcuts</b>, <b>Automation</b> and <b>About</b>.</li>
<li><b>Shortcuts</b> shows every layout’s keyboard shortcut in one place, ready to record or clear.</li>
<li><b>Automation</b> shows each display set’s automatic layout, and a ready-to-copy <code>screensetter://</code> link for every layout.</li>
<li>Updates, links and the license are in <b>About</b>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
